      en: ["Elevation: 7,952 meters (26,089 feet) above sea level", "Status: The highest non-8,000 meter peak in the world", "Location: Between Cho Oyu and Mt. Everest, Mahalangur Himal", "First Ascent: April 10, 1964, by a Japanese-Nepalese team", "Rank: 15th highest mountain in the world", "Access: Known for its isolation and technical difficulty"],
